WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.730
Tomohane's picture diary.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.940
It's summer. It's really hot.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.540
You all look troubled.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.910
Master Kaoru.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.380
Right, why don't you go to the villa?

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.320
It's close to the sea so it'll be cool.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.950
You'll come too?

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.820
I have work with Karina.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.290
Oh no.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.660
I'll go there after finishing the job.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.130
It's no fun without Master Kaoru.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.060
Everyone nodded in agreement.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:39.040
But in truth, everyone was happy.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:48.510
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.810
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:58.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:15.270
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:22.110
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:28.950
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:36.730
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:41.500
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.170
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:48.370
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:54.180
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.510
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.850
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:07.960
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:14.000
A Room and Horror Stories and Me!

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:32.620
Hey, everyone. Let's play.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.720
Come on.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.600
Oh no.

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.330
Woof.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.070
- Woof.
- Woof woof.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:05.850
Water?

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:06.820
Thank you.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.920
That was fun.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.090
It's been a while since I exercised.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.320
I'll massage you.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.090
Sure.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.590
Grope, grope.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:20.160
Smooth as silk.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.470
Master Keita?

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.030
You pervert.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.640
I really can't take my eyes off of you.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.370
Yoko too?

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.910
Why are you here?

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:34.280
Oh, here.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.350
Midsummer greeting?

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.210
From Master Kaoru?

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:40.550
He invited us to come too.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:44.790
Compared to under a bridge, this beach is a different world.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:48.120
The sun, bikinis, and beautiful girls.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.060
Hello there!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.630
- No!
- Goodbye.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.400
You definitely need a leash.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.400
That's right.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.770
You guys are getting along really nice, huh?

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.810
On our way here,

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:09.310
I saw you guys playing, but you were really having fun.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.050
Really?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:15.720
I've rarely seen the 10 of you together.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.150
That was kind of unexpected and fresh.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.020
It's nice.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.990
Like all of you are united as one.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.500
I want to unite with you guys too, woof woof.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:30.630
I never really thought of that.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.100
He's right.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:36.540
Usually, each of us does what she wants.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:41.140
But there are times when we all gather.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.850
Like the other day.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:45.380
Right, that horror story competition.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.320
We went to Nadeshiko's room.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.050
It was so fun.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:50.450
Horror story?

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.590
Especially Iguigu's story.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.460
That sounds fun.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.830
Igusa, let them hear it.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:04:59.700
What's wrong?

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.300
Oh, nothing.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:10.540
Then, as requested.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.440
There was once a male fashion designer.

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:18.210
As he completes a new work,

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:21.820
he would always dress the mannequin in his office.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:24.950
It was a jinx for him.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.990
Doing so made the dress sell well.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:32.060
One day, he got a girlfriend.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:36.200
He began to have his girlfriend wear his new dress.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:41.070
The mannequin was no longer needed.

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:49.550
But the next day, when he returned home...

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.380
There was a nasty smell.

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:56.690
It seemed to come from the bedroom.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:06:00.320
It smelled like the garbage dump.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.290
And when the man opened the door...

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:06.360
What is this?

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:09.900
Then, he heard something.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:14.870
It was a mysterious voice as if coming from the depths of hell.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:19.510
Don't throw me away.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:29.350
But when he listened carefully...

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:32.390
Tap, tap, tap...

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:38.930
No!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.440
Oh, um...

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:58.450
It lacks impact for me.
I'm totally not scared.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.280
But you screamed just now.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:04.390
Tayune is a real scaredy-cat.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:07.020
It was awful at the horror story competition.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.430
I'm not a scaredy-cat.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.830
Look.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.030
See?

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.170
Poor you. But don't worry.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:22.040
I will protect you from scary things.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:25.270
I won't let this soft skin get damaged.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.340
I didn't expect that, Tayune.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:32.050
Right? The powerful girl is actually a scaredy-cat.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.350
The boasting scaredy-cat.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.320
Imari, Sayoka.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.990
Don't get full of yourselves.

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:42.060
- You two are scaredy-cats too.
- What?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.660
I know about it.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:48.830
You always go to the bathroom together at night because you're scared.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.530
You must not ever tell that.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.870
Let's have a duel.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.440
Please stop them.

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.810
Now now, you're not being mature.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:59.170
I mean, you really are a scaredy-cat.

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:03.910
I can foresee you running and crying.

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:06.050
Pissed!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.680
Furano's prediction won't come true!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:11.550
Now you've said it, you scaredy-cat.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.060
Scaredy-cat

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.090
Hang on, you two.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:17.660
Making things worse.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.160
I've had enough. In that case...

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.660
Right. United attack.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.270
Do you think...

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:28.770
you can win...

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.310
against me...

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.110
physically?

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:33.540
Collateral damage?

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.450
We got beaten by the scaredy-cat.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.050
You're still saying that?

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.820
Isn't it fine being a scaredy-cat?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.090
You don't have to deny it so much.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:47.690
Isn't it cuter to have some weaker sides?

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.690
What are you saying, you pervert?

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.560
Hey, you don't have to say that.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.500
Fat tail.

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:58.770
What?

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.870
What's with her?

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.740
I can't be weak.

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:09.380
Because I'm Master Kaoru's Inukami.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:13.350
I won't forgive you, Tayune.

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:14.280
Imari.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.390
It's time for revenge.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.490
Ouch.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.620
Count me in too.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.920
Must be done.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.160
Wait.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.830
Count me in too.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.330
Yoko.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.530
I'll do it too.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:30.470
She hurt my pride.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.800
Hold up.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:34.700
Once she cools down,
Tayune will apologize.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:36.310
I won't allow a quarrel.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:39.010
Seems like curly perm disagrees.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.240
Curly...

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:45.510
A leader who couldn't restrain
Tayune should just stay quiet.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.550
It's a tough road ahead.

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:51.050
Do not come if you are not a comrade.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:52.320
Everyone.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:57.190
If you insist on fighting, then no dinner tonight.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.860
Do not come.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.200
Hey.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.670
Just let them be.

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:06.740
Sendan.

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:14.280
But we were getting along so well just now.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.410
They really can't be helped.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.010
Oh well, let them be.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.320
Master Keita?

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.290
Was it my imagination?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.300
"Inukami!"

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:36.970
Woof woof.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.900
"Inukami!"

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.670
Woof woof.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.780
Inukami ladies...

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.480
May I help you?

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.750
I just wanted to talk.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:01.220
Definitely not stealing panties or creeping up.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:02.990
I'm so sorry.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:06.060
Please don't wander around too much.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.500
Yes. By the way, what's this room?

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:13.770
The telecommunication room.
It's mainly used by Igusa.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.510
For example, when she's stock trading.

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:18.670
She does that?

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.240
She has talent for that kind of stuff.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:26.250
This villa and Master Kaoru's house were bought with that money.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:30.220
Really? I envy Kaoru.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.190
He has many excellent Inukami.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.090
All I got is a she-devil.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.960
But I would have too much trouble with 10 girls.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:41.760
He cares for all of you, right?

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.030
Yes.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.270
Thought so.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:47.300
Not something I could do.

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:51.410
If I cared too much for Inukami, they'll start to worry too.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.140
Oh, well.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:56.380
Everyone's gone.
I'll just play games with Tomohane.

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.850
- Where's the room?
- I'll show you.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.760
Geez, they're making this so hard.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.660
Umm, it's a truce.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.030
They want to apologize.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:18.870
So they want you to come to that cabin out back.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.300
They should've said so in the first place.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.710
Well, I might've also said a bit too much.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:30.280
Geez. Why all the way back here?

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:34.520
How was it?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.780
She's coming.

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:38.120
First phase, cleared.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.690
Are we really doing this?

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.160
Of course.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.890
She's scared of that story after all.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.200
Plan part 1, Iguigu calls out Tayune.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.370
2, scare her with the mannequin and chase her to the cabin.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.640
3, have team Furano be ready,

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:58.910
and deliver the final scare.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:02.740
And 4, take pictures of the crying Tayune.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:06.210
With pictures, she can't deny that she's a scaredy-cat anymore.

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:09.750
You're only good at planning bad things.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:10.990
Quiet, she's here.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.360
It's about time.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.660
Yoko, what are you doing with the mannequin?

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:22.530
Taking pics of the preparation.

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:34.010
Sure is creepy here.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.480
What's that?

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:40.750
Wait, what's going on?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:41.750
What's happening?

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.750
What should I do?

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.490
I'll report to Sendan.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:48.660
Tayune.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.390
I cannot be afraid.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.100
I'm Master Kaoru's Inukami.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:01.870
That's Purification Flash.
The pose for Tayune Tackle.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:02.940
She'll face it?

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.880
It's too scary.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:27.760
Good grief, why me too?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:32.000
Come on now, Gokyoya.
We're three best buddies, aren't we?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.900
Doesn't mean you should involve me.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.440
She's here.

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:38.070
Everyone, we'll jump out at once.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.880
That's some loud noise.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.740
What is this?

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:14.480
What's this place?

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:18.080
Have you ever heard of a basement in the cabin?

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.280
No.

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.480
It's all hidden too.

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:23.750
It's really creepy.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:25.990
It reminds me...

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:26.790
Of what?

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.120
The story Igusa told.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:33.360
As the man enters the room, there's a mannequin on his bed.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.100
Don't say stupid things.

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.170
Is it real?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.640
A mannequin? Wait, this is...

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:51.510
Wait for me.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:55.550
It's too scary.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.550
Good grief. What are you guys doing?

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:58.520
I'm so sorry.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.960
Tayune is so afraid, she's lost control.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.930
Nadeshiko and Tomohane are there.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.070
Purification Barrier Type 2.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.240
Purple Pillar.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.450
Sendan.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:26.610
Not yet.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.150
The barrier is...

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:35.390
Tayune's as strong as expected.
We can't do it alone.

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:40.400
Save me, Master Kaoru.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:52.240
Give me, your life...

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:59.350
Ouch.

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:04.490
Why did it turn out like this?

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.020
Master Kaoru.

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:09.720
Tayune.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.960
Master Kaoru.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.220
The villa is...

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.160
Safe?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.200
Master Kaoru?

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.170
Are you all right?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.440
Where's Master Kaoru?

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:56.740
Who saved me just now?

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:58.170
It was me.

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.310
I heard loud noises.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:03.510
And you were being chased by a weird doll.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:07.880
Tayune, you really are a scaredy-cat.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.420
There's no problem being a scaredy-cat.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:16.660
Or do you think you'll hold back Kaoru if you're weak?

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:20.030
You're worried about that, right?

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.930
That's why you act strong.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.700
But he doesn't care...

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.840
I know. Master Kaoru is kind.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:30.440
He won't neglect me just because of that.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:33.440
But I don't want to rely on his kindness.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:40.150
Wouldn't it be better if you show him your true self?

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.080
And not just to Kaoru.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.750
Tayune.

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:48.260
Master Keita?

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.260
It's fine now.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.530
What's going on?

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:54.800
What is that mannequin?

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:56.760
Here.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.640
A lesser spirit.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:03.810
Lesser spirit?

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:07.310
By nature, Inukami have high aura.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:10.110
If they quarrel,

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:13.350
the spiritual space gets disturbed and attracts weird things.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:22.120
Sorry, Tayune.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:25.130
We went too far.

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.230
We won't do it again.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.500
We're so sorry.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:33.200
No, I was being stubborn too.

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.000
When I'm a scaredy-cat.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.240
Tayune.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.340
And to Master Keita too.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.680
It's fine, don't let it bother you.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.310
Forgive me, Keita.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:46.050
Yoko, you... Ouch, ouch.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.050
What was that?

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:54.090
I didn't see it clearly.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:57.360
But its face looked like Master Kaoru's.

00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:01.800
Did we do a bad thing?

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:05.570
We discovered something hidden...

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:09.440
What if it was something related to Master Kaoru?

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.470
Let's pretend we didn't see anything.

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:17.350
What's wrong, everyone?

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:21.750
Umm, it's...

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.850
Nothing.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.020
Right?

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:27.660
That's right.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:29.660
Look, everyone's gathering.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.460
Let's apologize to Tayune.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.530
I'm so sorry.

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:36.060
Let's pretend we didn't see it.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:37.000
Right.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:45.010
All right, seems like you all made up.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:48.280
Now, to celebrate making up...

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:49.910
Let's all do something.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:56.380
I know, let's bathe together.

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:00.920
Of course, including myself.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.560
Keita!

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.230
You guys are really in sync.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.970
That's a good thing.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.870
You reap what you sow.

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:43.000
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:48.440
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:53.510
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:58.850
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:01.820
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:04.450
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:07.060
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:10.630
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.560
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.300
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:21.540
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:23.910
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:26.610
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:32.880
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:35.520
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:38.250
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:41.820
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:53.840
Inukami!

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:54.870
See you!

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:55.900
Next episode preview

00:22:55.900 --> 00:23:00.070
Romeo passionately loved
Juliet as if he was on fire.

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:03.240
"O Romeo, wherefore art thou Romeo?"

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:08.050
Hearing that, Romeo hiding under a 13-year-old girl's porch,

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:09.720
suddenly said this.

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:14.060
"By love, who first did prompt me to inquire."

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:17.090
He has the making of a pervert.

00:23:17.690 --> 00:23:19.330
Next on Inukami.

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:21.130
I Kinda See Something!

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:24.270
Everyone, make sure to choose your partner carefully.
